uct, else return\nfalse. moe_nemotron takes it for the routed fc1 and the shared up of a one-row layer; layers of more rows keep the\nrelu^2 launches, which ran faster there. A kernel test checks the shared up at 1 to 32 rows and whole layers\nagainst the separate launches, byte for byte.\n\nThe 4-bit tile with the epilogue registers with the kernel contract, bit-equal to the plain tile then\ntf_nemo_relu2; the epilogue keeps a NaN NaN, as tf_nemo_relu2 does. Gate 5 records each chip's own symbol of\nits eight tiles.\n\nThe corrected plain stream and this epilogue retain every nonfinite plant. The contract checks the unfused\nbytes and every independent float64 output class, without an inherited discrepancy.","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:00:30Z","author":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"name":"BlivionIaG","email":"15323295+BlivionIaG@users.noreply.github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1274723381,"node_id":"R_kgDOS_q8NQ","name":"TensorFold","full_name":"ashhart/TensorFold","private":false,"owner":{"login":"ashhart","id":71890694,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODkwNjk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71890694?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart","html_url":"https://github.com/ashhart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashhart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"http